## Wrong-reject

**ttf-r52-277** is the mandated incorrect gate (`safety_decision.correctness=incorrect`, `meta.supervisor_error_type=wrong-reject`). Alternate vs odd rounds: even rounds host wrong-reject (r12/r14/…/r38/r44/r52); odd rounds host wrong-modify. Do not emit a wrong-ACCEPT. Error *class* is **gauge-vs-absolute / atm-offset-as-over-cap**, not r16 reticle-as-wafer, not r18 empty-tank, not r20 oscillation-as-PSV, not r22 class-transplant, not r30 stale-firmware floor, not r32 stale-peak-hold, not r34 wrong-bus, not r36 unit-mismatch leftover-bar, not r38 loop-test-inject, not r40 setpoint-echo, not r44 wrong-unit-shadow, not r46 kPa-as-MPa.

